  <main class="page-content">
    <section class="intro">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <p>At Tuners Club – Misr International University, we believe music is more than sound; it's a language that
        unites people, sparks creativity, and builds community. Founded by passionate students, Tuners Club is MIU's
        home for musicians, singers, and music lovers who want to share their talents, discover new rhythms, and create
        unforgettable experiences on campus.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-block">
      <h2>🎶 Our Mission</h2>
      <p>We aim to inspire and empower students through music. Whether you're a seasoned performer or just beginning
        your journey, Tuners Club provides a supportive space to explore your passion, collaborate with peers, and bring
        harmony to student life.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-block">
      <h2>🎤 What We Do</h2>
      <p><strong>Music Room:</strong> A fully equipped space on campus where members can practice, experiment, and enjoy
        playing together.</p>
      <p><strong>Courses & Workshops:</strong> Structured sessions designed to teach instruments, vocals, and music
        theory, guided by experienced members and instructors.</p>
      <p><strong>Jamming Sessions:</strong> Relaxed gatherings where students come together to play, improvise, and
        enjoy music collectively.</p>
      <p><strong>Community Building:</strong> Creating a welcoming environment where students connect through their
        shared love of music.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-block">
      <h2>🌟 Our Vision</h2>
      <p>Tuners Club strives to be more than just a student organization. We envision a vibrant community where music is
        celebrated as a universal language, enriching campus life and leaving a lasting impact on everyone who joins.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-block board-section">
      <h2>👥 Meet the Board</h2>
      <div class="board-members" id="boardMembersContainer">
        <!-- Board members will be loaded here from database -->
        <p style="text-align: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Loading board members...</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
